OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after falling from Harvey
OL,4,ANichols building in Edinburgh
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after falling from the
OL,7,FHarvey Nichols building in Edinburgh
OL,8,Fcity centre.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,11,Fdepartment store, on St Andrew Square,
OL,12,Fat about 11:35.
OL,14,FPolice Scotland and Scottish Ambulance
OL,15,FService crews attended but the man was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FThe force said that he had "fallen from
OL,19,Fheight" and inquiries were ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
